      "t": "So while the governor is whipped with birch branches in the steam bath, Pasha has to hold the receiver tightly to his ear and admit that he is only slightly better than a monkey. Next time, in our final scene of the episode, Marina comes to Arkady's room late at night to thank him. See you then. See you next time!",
